  "caveats": [
    "Several members are convergence or low-count biomarker findings with modest correlations; the support is for a shared neighborhood, not interchangeability.",
    "Pi4ka pineal evidence is explicitly low-n and should be treated as a lead set rather than a robust recurrent module."
  ],
  "prior_expectation": {
    "summary": "ATP6V0C is a V0 proton-pore subunit, PI4KA maintains plasma-membrane PI4P and PI(4,5)P2, DHDDS supplies dolichol-phosphate for ER glycosylation, and VPS53/VPS54 participate in endosomal/TGN tethering; these prior functions make endomembrane convergence plausible.",
